  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Electrificacin Rural Sostenible y Productivo en la Amazona Peruana</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable and Productive Rural Electrification Program in the Peruvian Amazon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de este programa es promover el desarrollo sostenible a travs del acceso a energa renovable en la Amazona Peruana. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) brindar acceso a energa elctrica confiable y ambientalmente sostenible; y (ii) mejorar la capacidad de gestin de sistemas elctricos rurales aislados.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of this program is to promote sustainable development through access to renewable energy in the Peruvian Amazon. The specific objectives are: (i) to provide access to reliable and environmentally sustainable electricity; and (ii) to improve the management capacity of isolated rural electricity systems.</narrative>
  </description>
